{"id": "police-event-overhead-retention", "title": "Police collected event overhead and kept it in the overtime fund", "seconds": 47.8, "voice": "elevenlabs:OUMCzFUTd0F4Q6lkLkco", "narrator": "Roxy", "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "1fc3db862036fdc5", "words": 123, "beats": [{"scene": "p", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "San Francisco police collected overhead for off-duty work. Where did it go?", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 5.88, "shot": "s0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["Where", "did", "the", "overhead", "go?"], "sub": "Police retained administrative fees in their overtime account"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.34, 0.91, 1.29, 1.77, 2.28, 2.49, 3.01, 3.85, 4.13, 4.31, 4.42]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Customers paid a 22.6 percent charge on top of officer pay.", "t0": 5.88, "t1": 10.32, "shot": "s1", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "ledger", "layout": "table", "heading": "Private-payer fees", "context": "FY1995–96", "rows": [{"label": "Gross receipts", "value": "$3,112,906"}, {"label": "Overhead rate", "value": "22.6%"}]}, "wt": [0.04, 0.66, 0.91, 0.98, 1.55, 1.86, 2.15, 2.58, 3.04, 3.19, 3.48, 3.62, 4.07]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Auditors found the department kept that overhead in its overtime account.", "t0": 10.44, "t1": 14.48, "shot": "s2", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "ledger", "kicker": "Police retained administrative fees in their overtime account", "text": "Fund destination", "mark": "Fund"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.61, 0.87, 0.99, 1.54, 1.78, 2.01, 2.56, 2.69, 2.89, 3.46]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The estimated ceiling exceeded $700,000.", "t0": 14.7, "t1": 18.08, "shot": "s3", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "ledger", "kicker": "The audit’s $703,517 was an upper estimate", "text": "Upper estimate", "mark": "Upper"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.7, 1.13, 1.63, 2.0, 2.35, 2.78]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Auditors said the actual amount was probably lower.", "t0": 18.2, "t1": 21.0, "shot": "s4", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "ledger", "kicker": "The audit’s $703,517 was an upper estimate", "text": "Unverified balance", "mark": "Unverified"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.55, 0.76, 0.89, 1.26, 1.57, 1.73, 2.31]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "At Candlestick, the teams paid for security inside. The City covered the rest.", "t0": 21.12, "t1": 26.33, "shot": "s5", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "sports", "kicker": "Stadium bills covered inside security under separate agreements", "text": "Stadium agreements", "mark": "Stadium"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.21, 0.98, 1.1, 1.51, 1.82, 1.99, 2.52, 3.65, 3.85, 4.18, 4.56, 4.67]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "That split covered 97 games in one fiscal year.", "t0": 26.45, "t1": 29.88, "shot": "s6", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "sports", "layout": "table", "heading": "Candlestick", "context": "97 games", "rows": [{"label": "Teams paid", "value": "$340,069"}, {"label": "General Fund", "value": "$765,292"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.26, 0.69, 1.07, 1.74, 2.13, 2.3, 2.54, 3.03]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "Four street fairs received authorized waivers under a different rule.", "t0": 30.0, "t1": 33.89, "shot": "s7", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "fairs", "kicker": "Four authorized street-fair waivers followed a different rule", "text": "Street fair waivers", "mark": "Street"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.39, 0.77, 1.18, 1.61, 2.2, 2.78, 3.03, 3.1, 3.5]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "For 28 fairs, the fee was capped below the full cost.", "t0": 34.01, "t1": 37.58, "shot": "s8", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "ledger", "layout": "table", "heading": "28 street fairs", "context": "Police coverage", "rows": [{"label": "Collected", "value": "$44,390"}, {"label": "Cost", "value": "$595,426"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.73, 1.23, 1.36, 1.63, 1.82, 2.25, 2.59, 2.68, 2.96]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "Police said keeping the money helped cash flow.", "t0": 37.8, "t1": 40.32, "shot": "s9", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "follow", "kicker": "The analyst requested a separate financial audit", "text": "Department response", "mark": "Department"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.38, 0.64, 0.99, 1.08, 1.38, 1.68, 2.05]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "The analyst asked the Controller to trace the General Fund transfer.", "t0": 40.44, "t1": 44.18, "shot": "s10", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "The General Fund transfer"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.72, 1.08, 1.2, 1.73, 1.84, 2.2, 2.31, 2.71, 2.99]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 44.3, "t1": 46.91, "shot": "end", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.41, 0.8, 0.97, 1.29, 1.39, 1.48, 1.78, 2.11]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"p": "Police retained administrative fees in their overtime account", "b": "The audit’s $703,517 was an upper estimate", "o": "The analyst requested a separate financial audit"}, "look": "newsroom", "hook": "person"}